NeBULA2025
==========

Standardized reaching motor-execution EEG dataset (NeBULA) [1]_.

Dataset Overview
----------------
  Code: NeBULA2025
  Paradigm: imagery
  DOI: 10.1038/s41597-025-05042-4
  Subjects: 39
  Sessions per subject: 1
  Events: reach_1=1, reach_2=2, reach_3=3
  Trial interval: [0, 2] s
  Runs per session: 3
  File format: BrainVision (BIDS)

